id: scam
name: Scam
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Bluff
requiresSkill: bluff
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 2 Hours
# "Increase your Riches by 1 for 1 day." A mark keeps the day - the Wealth fold counts it as 1 Riches more
# while it is held - ended with Cancel buff on this row.
gains: scam-riches
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Two hours tricking someone out of their money: your Riches 1 higher for a day.
text: >
  Scam: You trick someone into giving you their money.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Bluff
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 2 Hours
  –Effect: Increase your Riches by 1 for 1 day.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Bluff. Once the two hours are spent the card
# gives the Riches +1 (Scam) mark - 1 Riches more on the Wealth fold, for the Status and the Wealth Check -
# and Cancel buff on this row ends it when the day is over.
